# Lens: a relay of light. A 3 m post (Pillar3 at half scale: 1x3x1 m) with a large crystal on top - a light HUB
# with a small store ("Lens buffer") and ONE aimed beam to the hub on its target tile ("Lens range";
# StructureSystem::rebuildLightLinks). Spawned origin 1.5 above ground; the crystal's centre is Light.cpp's
# beamHeightOf (2.2 over the origin): keep them in step.
# SHAPE (a placeholder): a bronze post, the crystal over its top.
Prefab gameLens
	Global true
	Component Render
		ObjectContainer baseshapes
		Node Pillar3
		Type StaticMesh
		Color 0.6 0.42 0.18
		Scale 0.5
	Component Physics
		Body Static
		ContactEvents true
		Shape Box
		HalfExtents 0.5 1.5 0.5
	Component GameStructure
		MeleeRadius 1
		AlwaysShowResources true
	Component Scene
		Entity
			Name Crystal
			Position 0 2.2 0
			Component Render
				ObjectContainer gemsGlow
				Node Diamond
				Type StaticMesh
				Color 1 0.85 0.45
				Emissive 2.5
				Scale 0.5
